WEBVTT

00:13:58.771 --> 00:14:00.541
or at the European Parliament,

00:14:00.565 --> 00:14:03.200
he was confronted
with all kinds of critics.

00:14:03.224 --> 00:14:05.804
And his reaction was always the same:

00:14:06.501 --> 00:14:07.969
"We will fix that,

00:14:07.993 --> 00:14:10.544
and I will follow up on that
with my team."

00:14:11.167 --> 00:14:14.945
But such a debate shouldn't be held
in back rooms of Facebook,

00:14:14.969 --> 00:14:16.254
Twitter or Google --

00:14:16.278 --> 00:14:21.094
such a debate should be openly discussed
in new, cosmopolitan parliaments,

00:14:21.118 --> 00:14:25.978
in new institutions
that reflect the diversity of people

00:14:26.002 --> 00:14:30.544
contributing to a utopian project
of a global network.